# Build contexts are the repository root, because every service Dockerfile
# copies libs/fc_common in. That means everything here is sent to the daemon
# unless excluded -- including virtualenvs and local-only directories, which no
# image needs and which are large.
#
# The Dockerfiles only ever COPY libs/fc_common and services/<name>/, so
# nothing below is reachable from a build.
.git/
.github/
midpointpres/
.venv/
.venv-fabric/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
deploy/fabric/kubeconfig*
docs/
*.pdf
.env
